Canadian Alcoholometric Tables 1980
Author: Canada Revenue Agency, Government of Canada

  backend/internal/alcoholometry/alctab.bin is a compact re-encoding of
  ALC_TAB.TXT from the "Canadian Alcoholometric Tables 1980", published by
  the Canada Revenue Agency. It is a copy of the version available at:

    https://www.canada.ca/en/revenue-agency/services/tax/technical-information/
    excise-duty/tables-alcoholometry/canadian-alcoholometric-tables-1980.html

  The tables themselves are computed from the OIML general formula
  (International Organization of Legal Metrology, International
  Recommendation No. 22, Fourth International Conference of Legal
  Metrology, October 1972, First Edition 1973).

